findings.what:
Highrim (standard) shifts the hood and sleeves to a paler cream sand and adds painted strata. At the gameplay camera it reads beside the base, but it is hard to name alone.

Long Evening (deluxe) adds:
- a plum hood that is plainly distinct;
- amber heads;
- a 0.30 m lacquer fan.
It has no vfxTint.

